// Bitwise Operations Library
// Reusable bitwise operation macros

// @define andOp
// Performs AND on top two stack items
// Stack: [a, b] -> [a & b]
12 10 and
// @end

// @define orOp
// Performs OR on top two stack items
// Stack: [a, b] -> [a | b]
12 10 or
// @end

// @define xorOp
// Performs XOR on top two stack items
// Stack: [a, b] -> [a ^ b]
12 10 xor
// @end
